                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-sm-6"><img src="~/Content/Client/images/kids.png" class="img-responsive"></div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6 kids-text">
                            <h2>Kindergarten <span>Section</span></h2>
                            <p>The aim of education should be to teach the "Child To Think , Not What To Think". Do And Learn' is the principal followed to improve children so that they can orient themselves to the tangible world of space and time to formulate their ideas. </p>
